Verdict:
    The shared word 'unital' is not itself a theorem, but it is a guardrail:
    preserve the unit of measurement / identity / pair-incidence before
    quotienting.  The 22-flower, cbrt(31), q=6 formal unital row, q=3
    pair frame, and q=4 length-72 hint are useful only as labelled carriers.
